\# GCE Backend Rules

\#\# Purpose

This rule governs every backend implementation across the GCE platform.

Whenever creating or modifying:

\- API Routes  
\- Server Actions  
\- Business Services  
\- Supabase Queries  
\- Authentication  
\- Payments  
\- Notifications  
\- AI Logic  
\- Database Operations  
\- Background Jobs

always follow the official backend documentation before writing code.

